{"height": 7, "weight": 40, "base_experience": 60, "ev_yield": [{"stat": "attack", "value": 1}], "genus": "Flower Pokémon", "capture_rate": 255, "base_happiness": 70, "hatch_counter": 20, "growth_rate": "medium-slow", "egg_groups": ["plant"], "gender_rate": 4, "names": [{"language": "ja-hrkt", "name": "マダツボミ"}, {"language": "ja-roma", "name": "Madatsubomi"}, {"language": "ko", "name": "모다피"}, {"language": "zh-hant", "name": "喇叭芽"}, {"language": "fr", "name": "Chétiflor"}, {"language": "de", "name": "Knofensa"}, {"language": "es", "name": "Bellsprout"}, {"language": "it", "name": "Bellsprout"}, {"language": "ja", "name": "マダツボミ"}, {"language": "zh-hans", "name": "喇叭芽"}, {"language": "es-419", "name": "Bellsprout"}], "pokedex_entries": [{"versions": ["red", "blue"], "text": "A carnivorous POKéMON that traps and eats bugs. It uses its root feet to soak up needed moisture."}, {"versions": ["yellow"], "text": "Prefers hot and humid places. It ensnares tiny insects with its vines and devours them."}, {"versions": ["gold", "heartgold", "x"], "text": "Even though its body is extremely skinny, it is blindingly fast when catching its prey."}, {"versions": ["silver"], "text": "It plants its feet deep underground to replenish wa­ ter. It can't es­ cape its enemy while it's rooted."}, {"versions": ["crystal"], "text": "If it notices anything that moves, it immediately flings its vine at the object."}, {"versions": ["ruby", "sapphire"], "text": "BELLSPROUT’s thin and flexible body lets it bend and sway to avoid any attack, however strong it may be. From its mouth, this POKéMON spits a corrosive fluid that melts even iron."}, {"versions": ["emerald"], "text": "A BELLSPROUT’s thin and flexible body lets it bend and sway to avoid any attack, however strong it may be. From its mouth, it leaks a fluid that melts even iron."}, {"versions": ["firered", "y"], "text": "Its bud looks like a human face. Because of the bud, it is rumored to be a type of legendary mandrake plant."}, {"version